sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Client as 💻 React Client
    participant Server as ⚙️ Node.js Backend
    participant Firebase as ☁️ Firebase Services

    User->>Client: Log in / Sign up
    Client->>Firebase: Authenticate User
    Firebase-->>Client: Auth Token & User Info
    
    User->>Client: Uploads Resume (📄 PDF)
    Client->>Server: POST /api/process-resume
    
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over Server: 📄 Parse PDF & Extract Skills
    end
    
    Server-->>Client: Returns Extracted Skills & Text
    
    Client->>Server: POST /api/start-interview (Context)
    
    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
    Note over Server: 🧠 Generate Questions via Flan-T5
    end
    
    Server-->>Client: Returns Question List
    
    loop 🎤 Interview Process
        Server-->>Client: AI Question Context
        Client->>User: 🔊 Text-to-Speech (Reads Question)
        User->>Client: 🗣️ Speaks Answer (Mic)
        Client->>Client: Web Speech API transcribes live
        Client->>Server: POST /api/generate-question (w/ Answer)
        
        rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over Server: 🧠 Generate contextual follow-up
        end
        
        Server-->>Client: Returns Next Question
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over Client,Firebase: 📊 Generate & Compile Performance Report
    Client->>Firebase: Save Report to 🗄️ Firestore
    end
    
    Client->>User: Display Interview Feedback & 📈 Metrics
